  "description": {
    "raw": "You may cast this spell immediately prior to spending 1 day\nof downtime to promote a business (see page 85 of Ultimate\nCampaign). The spell is cast on a building you wish to promote,\nwhich is magically bestowed with magical decorations and\nother improvements that make it generally more appealing,\nand it is treated as seeing increased activity for the spell’s\nduration. If the spell is cast on a building that you do not\npromote immediately thereafter, the spell is expended with\nno effect.\n\nAfter the initial day of downtime spent promoting your\nbuilding, the spell maintains the influx of activity for a number\nof days equal to half your caster level (maximum 5 days). During\nthis time, you needn’t spend additional downtime to promote\nthe building, but you must spend capital as normal to promote\nthe building. The capital the affected building generates for\nyou is unaffected by the spell. If you spend 1 day promoting a\ndifferent building than the target of this spell while this spell\nremains active, the spell immediately ends.",
    "search_text": "\"you may cast this spell immediately prior to spending 1 day\\nof downtime to promote a business (see page 85 of ultimate\\ncampaign). the spell is cast on a building you wish to promote,\\nwhich is magically bestowed with magical decorations and\\nother improvements that make it generally more appealing,\\nand it is treated as seeing increased activity for the spell’s\\nduration. if the spell is cast on a building that you do not\\npromote immediately thereafter, the spell is expended with\\nno effect.\\n\\nafter the initial day of downtime spent promoting your\\nbuilding, the spell maintains the influx of activity for a number\\nof days equal to half your caster level (maximum 5 days). during\\nthis time, you needn’t spend additional downtime to promote\\nthe building, but you must spend capital as normal to promote\\nthe building. the capital the affected building generates for\\nyou is unaffected by the spell. if you spend 1 day promoting a\\ndifferent building than the target of this spell while this spell\\nremains active, the spell immediately ends.\"",
    "sections": [],
    "document": {
      "node_type": "document",
      "content": [
        {
          "node_type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "node_type": "text",
              "value": "You may cast this spell immediately prior to spending 1 day of downtime to promote a business (see page 85 of "
            },
            {
              "node_type": "text",
              "value": "Ultimate Campaign",
              "marks": [
                "italic"
              ]
            },
            {
              "node_type": "text",
              "value": "). The spell is cast on a building you wish to promote, which is magically bestowed with magical decorations and other improvements that make it generally more appealing, and it is treated as seeing increased activity for the spell’s duration. If the spell is cast on a building that you do not promote immediately thereafter, the spell is expended with no effect. "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "node_type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "node_type": "text",
              "value": "After the initial day of downtime spent promoting your building, the spell maintains the influx of activity for a number of days equal to half your "
            },
            {
              "node_type": "entity_link",
              "value": "caster level",
              "relationship_id": "spell.business-booms:uses_definition:rule.caster-level"
            },
            {
              "node_type": "text",
              "value": " (maximum 5 days). During this time, you needn’t spend additional downtime to promote the building, but you must spend capital as normal to promote the building. The capital the affected building generates for you is unaffected by the spell. If you spend 1 day promoting a different building than the target of this spell while this spell remains active, the spell immediately ends."
            }
          ]
        }
